<https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/KB/RecordSet/F%20223-1> <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#scopeAndContent> "Series consists of personal records and photographs created and maintained by Conn Smythe that document his family life, military career and personal activities including philanthropic work, recreational pursuits and attendance at social functions.  The records are arranged into two sub-series." .
<https://data.archives.gov.on.ca/Schema/Description-Listings/relatedMaterial> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Can be enriched by using rico:hasGeneticLinktoRecordResource object property to link to another record resource internal to the AO with a provenance-based relationship. A super-property for a more generic link is rico:RecordResourcetoRecordResourceRelation, which has several other sub-properties."@en .
